# Pipeline artifacts.
#
# The two route geojsons are large (13 MB + 4 MB) and regenerate in seconds
# from data/ + config/, so they stay out of git.
#
# The three JSON artifacts below are deliberately NOT ignored. They are small,
# they diff cleanly, and normalisation_map.json in particular is the record of
# why every place name changed -- keeping it in the repo means a reviewer can
# check a merge without installing or running anything.
output/routes_clean.geojson
output/routes_flagged.geojson

.venv/
venv/
.pytest_cache/
.idea/
.vscode/
